{"parse": {"title": "Clue turtle", "pageid": 589785, "revid": 15223900, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Infobox NPC\n|name = Clue turtle\n|image = [[File:Clue turtle.png|290px]]\n|release = [[19 November]] [[2025]]\n|update = Sailing is OUT TODAY!\n|members = Yes\n|race = Turtle\n|location = Varies\n|options = Retrieve\n|examine = A messenger with a bottle!\n|map = No\n|dropversion = Levels 5-29,Levels 30-49,Levels 50-69,Levels 70+\n|id = 15124\n|leagueRegion = No\n}}\n'''Clue turtles''' are [[ocean encounter]]s found while [[Sailing]]. Interacting with one grants 50 Sailing experience and a [[clue scroll]] or [[scroll box]], as long as the [[scroll case|clue limit]] hasn't been reached.\n\nEach clue tier has a minimum Sailing level to obtain; for example, at level 5, the turtle only offers easy clues, but easy through elite clues can be given at level 70 and above.\n\n{|class=\"wikitable align-center-3\"\n!colspan=2 | Clue tier\n!Min. level\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Clue scroll (easy)}} || 5\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Clue scroll (medium)}} || 30\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Clue scroll (hard)}} || 50\n|-\n|{{plinkt|Clue scroll (elite)}} || 70\n|}\n\n==Sailing info==\n{{Sailing info\n|version1 = Easy\n|version2 = Medium\n|version3 = Hard\n|version4 = Elite\n|level1 = 5\n|level2 = 30\n|level3 = 50\n|level4 = 70\n|xp = 50\n|dropversion1 = Levels 5-29\n|dropversion2 = Levels 30-49\n|dropversion3 = Levels 50-69\n|dropversion4 = Levels 70+\n}}\n\n===Rewards===\n\nWithin a given level range, the probability to receive a particular clue tier remains constant. Note that clue scrolls will instead drop as [[scroll boxes]] after the completion of [[X Marks the Spot]].\n\n====Levels 5-29====\n{{DropLogProject|kills=955}}\n\n{{DropsTableHead|dropversion=Levels 5-29}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=Sailing|name=Clue scroll (easy)|quantity=1|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n====Levels 30-49====\n{{DropLogProject|kills=1628}}\n\n{{DropsTableHead|dropversion=Levels 30-49}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=Sailing|name=Clue scroll (easy)|quantity=1|rarity=8/20|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=Sailing|name=Clue scroll (medium)|quantity=1|rarity=12/20|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n====Levels 50-69====\n{{DropLogProject|kills=2888}}\n\n{{DropsTableHead|dropversion=Levels 50-69}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=Sailing|name=Clue scroll (easy)|quantity=1|rarity=9/20|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=Sailing|name=Clue scroll (medium)|quantity=1|rarity=6/20|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=Sailing|name=Clue scroll (hard)|quantity=1|rarity=5/20|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n====Levels 70+====\n{{DropLogProject|kills=3418}}\n\n{{DropsTableHead|dropversion=Levels 70+}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=Sailing|name=Clue scroll (easy)|quantity=1|rarity=9/20|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=Sailing|name=Clue scroll (medium)|quantity=1|rarity=6/20|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=Sailing|name=Clue scroll (hard)|quantity=1|rarity=3/20|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|skill=Sailing|name=Clue scroll (elite)|quantity=1|rarity=2/20|approx=yes}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n==Transcript==\n{{Hastranscript|npc}}\n\n==Trivia==\n* [[Harold (turtle)|Harold]], a clue turtle, can be found on a small island next to [[Chinchompa Island]].\n\n{{Ocean encounters}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:21:59.138948+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort=4,a\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"border-right: none;\" class=\"drops-img-header drop-disp-btn unsortable\" title=\"Sort items by category, rarity and name.\"></th>\n<th style=\"border-left: none;\" class=\"item-col\">Item</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">Quantity</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th class=\"ge-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th>\n<th class=\"alch-column\" data-sort-type=\"number\">High Alch</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td class=\"inventory-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Clue_scroll_(easy)\" title=\"Clue s